{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114457","id":3137756936,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc67Bl8I","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114457","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114457.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114457.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114457","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114457/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114457/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114457/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d1a5d9da3e8bd32adf6fbcb8f7734bcedf70176f","number":114457,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Always stop script debugger when stopping game (reverted)","user":{"login":"kbieganski","id":9216518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyMTY1MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9216518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski","html_url":"https://github.com/kbieganski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kbieganski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #114173. Possibly fixes #111175.\r\n\r\nWhen restarting the game, stop the script debugger early to prevent it from stopping the new run.\r\n\r\nBefore this fix, what happens is:\r\n\r\n1. The play button is clicked, calls `EditorRunBar::play_main_scene()`\r\n    - Calls `EditorRunBar::stop_playing()`\r\n      - Calls `EditorRun::stop()`\r\n      - Calls `EditorDebuggerNode::stop()`\r\n        And that's it - the script debugger is not running\r\n    - Calls `EditorRunBar::_run_scene()`\r\n      - Calls `EditorDebuggerNode::start()`.\r\n\r\n2. `EditorDebuggerNode::_process()` is called\r\n   Editor enters game running mode.\r\n\r\n3. `ScriptEditorDebugger::_process()` is called\r\n    - `!is_session_active()`, so it calls `_stop_and_notify()`\r\n      - Calls `ScriptEditorDebugger::stop()`\r\n      - Signals `\"stopped\"`\r\n        Which calls `EditorDebuggerNode::_debugger_stopped()`\r\n        Which calls `EditorNode::notify_all_debug_sessions_exited()`\r\n        Which calls `EditorRunBar::stop_playing()`\r\n        And the editor leaves game running mode.\r\n\r\nAfter this fix:\r\n\r\n1. The play button is clicked, calls `EditorRunBar::play_main_scene()`\r\n    - Calls `EditorRunBar::stop_playing()`\r\n      - Calls `EditorRun::stop()`\r\n      - Calls `EditorDebuggerNode::stop()`\r\n        No longer checks if the debugger is running, so:\r\n        - Calls `ScriptEditorDebugger::_stop_and_notify()`\r\n          - Calls `ScriptEditorDebugger::stop()`\r\n          - ...ultimately calls `EditorRunBar::stop_playing()`\r\n            Which has no effect, as `editor_run` is `STATUS_STOP`\r\n    - Calls `EditorRunBar::_run_scene()`\r\n      - Calls `EditorDebuggerNode::start()`\r\n        - Calls `EditorDebuggerNode::stop()`\r\n          No longer checks if the debugger is running, so:\r\n          - Calls `ScriptEditorDebugger::_stop_and_notify()`\r\n            - Calls `ScriptEditorDebugger::stop()`\r\n            - ...ultimately calls `EditorRunBar::stop_playing()`\r\n              Which has no effect, as `editor_run` is `STATUS_STOP`\r\n\r\n2. `EditorDebuggerNode::_process()` is called\r\n   Happens several times...\r\n\r\n3. `EditorDebuggerNode::_process()` is called again\r\n   And this time the editor re-enters game running mode.\r\n\r\nI'm not happy with the `_run_scene()` being called so much, but I have no idea how to do it better.\r\nPerhaps someone more familiar with Godot internals can untangle this and do a clean fix.\r\n\r\nAlso, not sure why this doesn't happen on other platforms.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.githu